# A two tile counter piece with a sunk basin and a gooseneck tap. Goes in the
# middle of a run.
sprite kitchen-counter-sink
size 32 32
layer object
footprint 2 1
origin 0 16
tag counter kitchen sink
variant teal A=T a=t 4=6

frame default
